⍝ ==== s2 planes (Addendum A.1): a module is a lattice of cells (x, y, z), one plane per z
⍝ Every file of a compiler run is part of one module. A file holds one plane, or several,
⍝ each starting with a header line ⧉ z ⁿ; a file with no header is plane ○ of a one-plane
⍝ module. Each plane is lexed on its own, its lines numbered from 1 after its header, and
⍝ the planes are then folded into one token stream: line by line, cell by cell, the planes
⍝ taken in ascending z on odd lines and descending z on even ones.
⍝ A token's origin is packed into its line: y in bits 0-19, the header's line + 1 in bits
⍝ 20-39 (so a plane line is at least 2^20, and a plain one is below), the file in bits
⍝ 40-45, z + 128 in bits 46-53, and x + 1 in bits 54-62 (0 until folding). The parity of
⍝ the packed line is the parity of y, and the next line is the packed line + 1, so the
⍝ lexer runs unchanged on planes. A module of one file without a header is never packed:
⍝ it takes the old path, token for token.

⍝ ---- origins

⍝ ‹isplane› line: the line holds a plane origin
⦃ #1048576# ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⦃ ⊕ ⦄ ⦄ ⟨ℤ ⊸ ŧ⟩ ‹isplane› ⸫
⦃ #1048575# ⋒ ⦄ ⟨ℤ ⊸ ℤ⟩ ‹ply› ⸫
⦃ #20# ≫ #1048575# ⋒ ⦄ ⟨ℤ ⊸ ℤ⟩ ‹plh› ⸫
⦃ #40# ≫ #63# ⋒ ⦄ ⟨ℤ ⊸ ℤ⟩ ‹plf› ⸫
⦃ #46# ≫ #255# ⋒ #128# ⊟ ⦄ ⟨ℤ ⊸ ℤ⟩ ‹plz› ⸫
⦃ #54# ≫ ⦄ ⟨ℤ ⊸ ℤ⟩ ‹plx1› ⸫
⍝ ‹plline› line: the line in its file
⦃ ⧖:l ⧗:l ‹plh› △ ⊟ ⧗:l ‹ply› ⊞ ⦄ ⟨ℤ ⊸ ℤ⟩ ‹plline› ⸫
⍝ ‹plpack› y h f z x1
⦃ ⧖:y,h,f,z,x1 ⧗:y ⧗:h #20# ≪ ⊞ ⧗:f #40# ≪ ⊞ ⧗:z #128# ⊞ #46# ≪ ⊞ ⧗:x1 #54# ≪ ⊞ ⦄ ⟨ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ℤ⟩ ‹plpack› ⸫
⍝ ‹plsetx› line x: the line with its cell's x
⦃ ⧖:l,x ⧗:l △ #54# ≪ △ ⊟ ⋒ ⧗:x △ ⊞ #54# ≪ ⊞ ⦄ ⟨ℤ ℤ ⊸ ℤ⟩ ‹plsetx› ⸫

⍝ ---- printing positions

⍝ ‹pbt› v: v as a balanced-ternary numeral, least-significant trit first (§2)
⦃
  ⧖:v
  ⧗:v ○ ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ $○$ ⎙̵ ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  ⧗:v
  ⥀ ⦃ ⧖:v ⧗:v ⧗:v ○ ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⦃ ‹pbt1› ⊕ ⦄ ⁼ ⦄
  ⌁
⦄ ⟨ℤ ⊸⟩ ‹pbt› ⸫
⍝ ‹pbt1› v: print the lowest trit of v, giving the rest (⊜ gives the balanced remainder)
⦃
  ⧖:v
  ⧗:v #3# ⊜ ⁇ ⦃ ⦄ ⦃ ○ ⦄ ⧖:d
  ⧗:d #-1# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ $▽$ ⎙̵ ⦄ ∅ ⁼ ⧗:d ○ ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ $○$ ⎙̵ ⦄ ∅ ⁼ ⧗:d △ ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ $△$ ⎙̵ ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  ⧗:v ⧗:d ⊟ #3# ⊘ ⁇ ⦃ ⦄ ⦃ ○ ⦄
⦄ ⟨ℤ ⊸ ℤ⟩ ‹pbt1› ⸫

⍝ ‹plpos› line col: "line:col", with the cell's lattice coordinates if it is in a plane (A.1.2)
⦃
  ⧖:l,c
  ⧗:l,c ⧗:l ‹isplane› ⋔ ⦃ ‹plpos1› ⦄ ⦃ ⧖:l,c ⧗:l ᛁ $:$ ⎙̵ ⧗:c ᛁ ⦄ ⁼
⦄ ⟨ℤ ℤ ⊸⟩ ‹plpos› ⸫
⦃
  ⧖:l,c
  ⧗:l ‹plline› ᛁ $:$ ⎙̵ ⧗:c ᛁ $ ($ ⎙̵
  ⧗:l ‹plx1› ⍿⁰ ○ ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⦄ ⦃ $x=$ ⎙̵ △ ⊟ ᛁ $, $ ⎙̵ ⦄ ⁼
  $y=$ ⎙̵ ⧗:l ‹ply› ᛁ $, z=$ ⎙̵ ⧗:l ‹plz› ‹pbt› $)$ ⎙̵
⦄ ⟨ℤ ℤ ⊸⟩ ‹plpos1› ⸫

⍝ ‹ppath› path f: print file f of a module's path (its files are separated by U+0001)
⦃
  ⧖:path,f
  ⧗:patẖ,f ○ ○
  ⍝ the loop carries [path f i seg]
  ⥀ ⦃
    ⧖:path,f,i,seg
    ⧗:patẖ,i ᛑ ⧖:cp,len
    ⧗:cp ⧗:seg ⧗:f ᛖ ⧗:cp △ ᛖ ‹not› ⋎ ⧗:cp #-1# ᛖ ‹not› ⋎ ⋔ ⦃ ᚢ ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⦄ ⁼
    ⧗:patẖ,f ⧗:i ⧗:len ⊞ ⧗:seg ⧗:cp △ ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ △ ⊞ ⦄ ∅ ⁼
    ⧗:cp #-1# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⦃ ⊕ ⦄ ⁼
  ⦄
  ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁̱
⦄ ⟨⟗ʃ ℤ ⊸⟩ ‹ppath› ⸫

⍝ ‹sprseg› C s f: print file f of the heap string s
⦃
  ⧖:C,s,f
  ⧗:C̵ ⧗:s △ ⊞ ‹rd› ⧖:C,n
  ⧗:C̵,f ⧗:s #2# ⊞ ⧗:s #2# ⊞ ⧗:n ⊞ ○
  ⥀ ⦃
    ⧖:C,f,j,end,seg
    ⧗:C̵,f,j,end,seg ⧗:j ⧗:end ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⁼
      ⦃ ⧖:C,f,j,end,seg ⧗:C̵,j ‹rd› ⧖:C,cp
        ⧗:cp ⧗:seg ⧗:f ᛖ ⧗:cp △ ᛖ ‹not› ⋎ ⋔ ⦃ ᚢ ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⦄ ⁼
        ⧗:C̵,f ⧗:j △ ⊞ ⧗:end ⧗:seg ⧗:cp △ ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ △ ⊞ ⦄ ∅ ⁼ ⊕ ⦄
  ⦄
  ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹sprseg› ⸫

⍝ ‹spos› C ln cl: "line:col" (with the lattice coordinates of a plane cell) as a heap string
⦃
  ⧖:C,ln,cl
  ⧗:C̵,ln,cl ⧗:ln ‹isplane› ⋔ ⦃ ‹spos1› ⦄ ⦃ ⧖:C,ln,cl ⧗:C̵ %%!{#ln}:{#cl}%% ⦄ ⁼
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ⟩ ‹spos› ⸫
⦃
  ⧖:C,ln,cl
  ⧗:ln ‹plline› ⧖:fl ⧗:ln ‹plx1› △ ⊟ ⧖:x ⧗:ln ‹ply› ⧖:y ⧗:ln ‹plz› ⧖:z
  ⧗:C̵ %%!{#fl}:{#cl} (x={#x}, y={#y}, z=%% ⧖:C,a
  ⧗:C̵ ‹sbeg› ⧖:C,e ⧗:C̵,e,a ‹sapp› ⧖:C
  ⧗:C̵,e,z ‹sbt› ⧖:C
  ⧗:C̵ ⧗:e #41# ‹scp› ⧗:e ‹send›
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ⟩ ‹spos1› ⸫
⍝ ‹sbt› C e v: append v as a balanced-ternary numeral
⦃
  ⧖:C,e,v
  ⧗:C̵,e ⧗:v ○ ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ #9675# ‹scp› ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⦄ ⁼ ⧖:C
  ⧗:C̵,e,v
  ⥀ ⦃ ⧖:C,e,v ⧗:C̵,e,v ⧗:v ○ ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⦃ ‹sbt1› ⊕ ⦄ ⁼ ⦄
  ⌁ ⌁
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹sbt› ⸫
⦃
  ⧖:C,e,v
  ⧗:v #3# ⊜ ⁇ ⦃ ⦄ ⦃ ○ ⦄ ⧖:d
  ⧗:C̵,e #9675# ⧗:d △ ⊞ ⍿⁰ ○ ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ #9661# ⦄ ⦃ △ ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ #9651# ⦄ ⁼ ⦄ ⁼ ‹scp›
  ⧗:e ⧗:v ⧗:d ⊟ #3# ⊘ ⁇ ⦃ ⦄ ⦃ ○ ⦄
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ⟩ ‹sbt1› ⸫

⍝ ‹erratfl› path f fl: "file:line:1: error: " for a whole line of file f
⦃ ⧖:path,f,fl ⧗:patẖ,f ‹ppath› $:$ ⎙̵ ⧗:fl ᛁ $:1: error: $ ⎙̵ ⦄ ⟨⟗ʃ ℤ ℤ ⊸⟩ ‹erratfl› ⸫

⍝ ---- plane headers (A.1.1)

⍝ ‹skipsp› cps i le: the first index ≥ i that is not a space, or le
⦃
  ⧖:cps,i,le
  ⧗:cps̱,i,le
  ⥀ ⦃
    ⧖:cps,i,le
    ⧗:cps̱,i,le
    ⧗:i ⧗:le ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⊕ ⦄ ⁼ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⧗:cps̱,i ᚳ ᛋ ⋎
    ⋔ ⦃ ⧖:e △ ⊞ ⧗:e ⊕ ⦄ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⁼
  ⦄
  ⌁ ⧖:r ⌁̱ ⧗:r
⦄ ⟨⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ℤ⟩ ‹skipsp› ⸫
⍝ ‹skipns› cps i le: the first index ≥ i that is a space, or le
⦃
  ⧖:cps,i,le
  ⧗:cps̱,i,le
  ⥀ ⦃
    ⧖:cps,i,le
    ⧗:cps̱,i,le
    ⧗:i ⧗:le ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⊕ ⦄ ⁼ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⧗:cps̱,i ᚳ ᛋ ‹not› ⋎
    ⋔ ⦃ ⧖:e △ ⊞ ⧗:e ⊕ ⦄ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⁼
  ⦄
  ⌁ ⧖:r ⌁̱ ⧗:r
⦄ ⟨⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ℤ⟩ ‹skipns› ⸫

⍝ ‹ishdr› cps ls le: the line ls … le−1 is a plane header (it starts with ⧉)
⦃
  ⧖:cps,ls,le
  ⧗:cps̱,ls,le ‹skipsp› ⧖:i
  ⧗:cps̱,i ᚳ #10697# ᛖ ⧗:i ⧗:le ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⊕ ⦄ ⁼ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⋎
⦄ ⟨⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ŧ⟩ ‹ishdr› ⸫

⍝ ‹hashdr› cps: some line of the file is a plane header
⦃
  ⧖:cps
  ⧗:cps̱ ○ ⊕
  ⍝ the loop carries [cps ls found]
  ⥀ ⦃
    ⧖:cps,ls,found
    ⧗:cps̱,ls ‹eol› ⧖:le
    ⧗:cps̱ ⧗:le △ ⊞ ⧗:found ⧗:cps̱,ls,le ‹ishdr› ⋏
    ⍿⁰ ⧗:le ⧗:cps̱ ᚴ ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⁼ ⦃ ⊕ ⦄ ⋏ ⋔ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⦃ ⊕ ⦄ ⁼
  ⦄
  ⧖:cps,ls,found ⧗:found
⦄ ⟨⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ⊸ ŧ⟩ ‹hashdr› ⸫

⍝ ‹hdrparse› cps ls le: whether the header line is well formed, its z and its n
⦃
  ⧖:cps,ls,le
  ⧗:cps̱,ls,le ‹skipsp› ⧖:i0
  ⧗:cps̱ ⧗:i0 △ ⊞ ⧗:le ‹skipns› ⧖:e0
  ⧗:cps̱,e0,le ‹skipsp› ⧖:i1 ⧗:cps̱,i1,le ‹skipns› ⧖:e1
  ⧗:cps̱,e1,le ‹skipsp› ⧖:i2 ⧗:cps̱,i2,le ‹skipns› ⧖:e2
  ⧗:cps̱,e2,le ‹skipsp› ⧖:i3
  ⧗:cps̱,i1,e1 #4# ‹allcls› ⧖:okz
  ⧗:cps̱,i2,e2 #3# ‹allcls› ⧖:okn
  ⧗:e0 ⧗:i0 △ ⊞ ᛖ ⧗:okz ⋎ ⧗:okn ⋎ ⧗:i3 ⧗:le ᛖ ⋎ ⧖:ok
  ⧗:cps̱,i1,e1,ok ⧗:ok ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ‹btval› ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁̱ ○ ⦄ ⁼ ⧖:z
  ⧗:cps̱,i2,e2,ok ⧗:ok ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ‹supval› ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁̱ ○ ⦄ ⁼ ⧖:n
  ⧗:ok,z,n
⦄ ⟨⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ŧ ℤ ℤ⟩ ‹hdrparse› ⸫

⍝ ‹header› out cps path line ls le: a header line becomes a marker record
⍝ [99 line 1 0 −9 z n 0 0], whose line is the plane's origin with y = 0
⦃
  ⧖:out,cps,path,line,ls,le
  ⧗:cps̱,ls,le ‹hdrparse› ⧖:ok,z,n
  ⧗:line ‹plline› ⧖:fl
  ⧗:out̵,patẖ,line,fl,z,n ⧗:ok ⋔ ⦃ ‹hdrrec› ⦄ ⦃ ‹hdrbad› ⦄ ⁼
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ⟗ʃ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ◌⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹header› ⸫
⦃
  ⧖:out,path,line,fl,z,n
  ⧗:out̵ #99# ⍆̵ ○ ⧗:fl △ ⊞ ⧗:line ‹plf› ⧗:z ○ ‹plpack› ⍆̵ △ ⍆̵ ○ ⍆̵ #-9# ⍆̵ ⧗:z ⍆̵ ⧗:n ⍆̵ ○ ⍆̵ ○ ⍆̵
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ⟗ʃ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ◌⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹hdrrec› ⸫
⦃
  ⧖:out,path,line,fl,z,n
  ⧗:patẖ ⧗:line ‹plf› ⧗:fl ‹erratfl›
  $malformed plane header: it is ⧉ z ⁿ, with z the plane's ordinal and n the number of planes (A.1.1)\n$ ⎙̵
  ⧗:out̵ ⌁̵ ↯
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ⟗ʃ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ◌⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹hdrbad› ⸫

⍝ ‹line2› out cps path line ls le: one line of a file, or a plane header
⦃
  ⧖:out,cps,path,line,ls,le
  ⧗:out̵,cps̱,patẖ,line,ls,le ⧗:line ‹isplane› ⋔ ⦃ ‹line2p› ⦄ ⦃ ‹line› ⦄ ⁼
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ⟗ʃ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ◌⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹line2› ⸫
⦃
  ⧖:out,cps,path,line,ls,le
  ⧗:out̵,cps̱,patẖ,line,ls,le ⧗:cps̱,ls,le ‹ishdr› ⋔ ⦃ ‹header› ⦄ ⦃ ‹line› ⦄ ⁼
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ⟗ʃ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ◌⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹line2p› ⸫

⍝ ‹nextl› cps ls le line: the line after this one (a header starts its plane's y again)
⦃
  ⧖:cps,ls,le,line
  ⧗:cps̱,ls,le,line ⧗:line ‹isplane› ⋔ ⦃ ‹nextlp› ⦄ ⦃ ⧖:l ⌁ ⌁ ⌁̱ ⧗:l △ ⊞ ⦄ ⁼
⦄ ⟨⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ℤ⟩ ‹nextl› ⸫
⦃
  ⧖:cps,ls,le,line
  ⧗:cps̱,ls,le,line ⧗:cps̱,ls,le ‹ishdr› ⋔ ⦃ ‹hdrnext› ⦄ ⦃ ⧖:l ⌁ ⌁ ⌁̱ ⧗:l △ ⊞ ⦄ ⁼
⦄ ⟨⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ℤ⟩ ‹nextlp› ⸫
⦃
  ⧖:cps,ls,le,line
  ⧗:cps̱,ls,le ‹hdrparse› ⧖:ok,z,n
  △ ⧗:line ‹plline› △ ⊞ ⧗:line ‹plf› ⧗:z ○ ‹plpack›
⦄ ⟨⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ℤ⟩ ‹hdrnext› ⸫

⍝ ---- folding (A.1.2)

⍝ ‹reclen› toks j: the length of the record at slot j
⦃ ⧖:toks,j ⧗:toks̱ ⧗:j #7# ⊞ ᚳ ⧖:n ⧗:toks̱ ⧗:j #8# ⊞ ⧗:n ⊞ ᚳ ⧗:n ⊞ #9# ⊞ ⦄ ⟨⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ⊸ ℤ⟩ ‹reclen› ⸫

⍝ ‹isbreath› toks j: the record at j is a breath ⸱, which holds a cell and is then dropped
⦃
  ⧖:toks,j
  ⧗:toks̱,j ᚳ #8# ᛖ ⧗:toks̱ ⧗:j #7# ⊞ ᚳ △ ᛖ ⋎ ⧗:toks̱ ⧗:j #8# ⊞ ᚳ #11825# ᛖ ⋎
⦄ ⟨⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ⊸ ŧ⟩ ‹isbreath› ⸫

⍝ The plane table P holds seven slots per plane: z n file start end header hline, where
⍝ start … end−1 are its records' positions in the index X, header is 1 if the plane has a
⍝ header, and hline is the header's packed line (with y = 0).

⦃ ⧖:P,p,k ⧗:P̵ ⧗:p #7# ⊠ ⧗:k ⊞ ‹rd› ⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ⟩ ‹pget› ⸫
⦃ ⧖:P,p,k,v ⧗:P̵ ⧗:p #7# ⊠ ⧗:k ⊞ ⧗:v ‹wr› ⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹pput› ⸫
⦃ ‹len› #7# ⊘ ⁇ ⦃ ⦄ ⦃ ○ ⦄ ⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ⟩ ‹pnum› ⸫

⍝ ‹ptscan› toks path: the plane table and the index of the records (breaths included)
⦃
  ⧖:toks,path
  ⧗:toks̱,patẖ ⟦ ○ ⟧ ⟦ ○ ⟧ #6# #-1#
  ⍝ the loop carries [toks path P X j cur]
  ⥀ ⦃
    ⧖:toks,path,P,X,j,cur
    ⧗:toks̱,patẖ,P̵,X̵,j,cur ⧗:j ⧗:toks̱ ᚴ ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⁼
      ⦃ ⧖:toks,path,P,X,j,cur ⧗:toks̱,patẖ,P̵,X̵,j,cur ‹ptscan1› ⧖:P,X,j,cur ⧗:toks̱,patẖ,P̵,X̵,j,cur ⊕ ⦄
  ⦄
  ⧖:toks,path,P,X,j,cur ⧗:P̵,X̵
⦄ ⟨⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ⟗ʃ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹ptscan› ⸫
⦃
  ⧖:toks,path,P,X,j,cur
  ⧗:toks̱,j ᚳ ⧖:kind
  ⧗:toks̱,patẖ,P̵,X̵,j,cur ⧗:kind #99# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ‹ptmark› ⦄ ⦃ ‹ptrec› ⦄ ⁼ ⧖:P,X,cur
  ⧗:P̵,X̵ ⧗:j ⧗:toks̱,j ‹reclen› ⊞ ⧗:cur
⦄ ⟨⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ⟗ʃ ⟦ℤ⟧ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ⟩ ‹ptscan1› ⸫
⍝ a header: a new plane, unless tokens of the same file came before it
⦃
  ⧖:toks,path,P,X,j,cur
  ⧗:toks̱ ⧗:j △ ⊞ ᚳ ⧖:line
  ⧗:P̵,cur #5# ‹pget› ⧖:P,hdr ⧗:P̵,cur #2# ‹pget› ⧖:P,f0 ⧗:P̵,cur #3# ‹pget› ⧖:P,s0
  ⧗:hdr ○ ᛖ ⧗:cur #-1# ᛖ ‹not› ⋎ ⧗:f0 ⧗:line ‹plf› ᛖ ⋎ ⧖:early
  ⧗:X̵ ⟗ ⧗:s0,toks̱,patẖ ⧗:early ⋔ ⦃ ‹ptearly› ⦄ ⦃ ⌁̱ ⌁̱ ⌁ ⌁̱ ⦄ ⁼ ⧖:X
  ⧗:X̵ ‹len› ⧖:X,at
  ⧗:P̵ ‹pnum› ⧖:P,np
  ⧗:P̵ ⧗:toks̱ ⧗:j #5# ⊞ ᚳ ⍆̵ ⧗:toks̱ ⧗:j #6# ⊞ ᚳ ⍆̵ ⧗:line ‹plf› ⍆̵ ⧗:at ⍆̵ ⧗:at ⍆̵ △ ⍆̵ ⧗:line ⍆̵
  ⧗:X̵ ⧗:np
⦄ ⟨⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ⟗ʃ ⟦ℤ⟧ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ⟩ ‹ptmark› ⸫
⦃
  ⧖:X,s0,toks,path
  ⧗:X̱,s0 ᚳ ⧖:r
  ⧗:toks̱ ⧗:r △ ⊞ ᚳ ⧖:ln ⧗:toks̱ ⧗:r #2# ⊞ ᚳ ⧖:cl
  ⧗:patẖ,ln,cl ‹errat› $a file with plane headers starts with one: this token comes before the first ⧉ (A.1.1)\n$ ⎙̵
  △ ‹exit›
⦄ ⟨⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ⟗ʃ ⊸⟩ ‹ptearly› ⸫
⍝ a token: into the index, in the current plane (the tokens of a file without a header are its plane ○)
⦃
  ⧖:toks,path,P,X,j,cur
  ⧗:toks̱ ⧗:j △ ⊞ ᚳ ‹plf› ⧖:f
  ⧗:P̵,cur #2# ‹pget› ⧖:P,f0
  ⧗:cur #-1# ᛖ ⧗:f0 ⧗:f ᛖ ‹not› ⋏ ⧖:fresh
  ⧗:X̵ ‹len› ⧖:X,at
  ⧗:P̵ ‹pnum› ⧖:P,np
  ⧗:P̵,at,f ⧗:fresh ⋔ ⦃ ⧖:a,ff ○ ⍆̵ △ ⍆̵ ⧗:ff ⍆̵ ⧗:a ⍆̵ ⧗:a ⍆̵ ○ ⍆̵ ○ ⍆̵ ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ ⦄ ⁼ ⧖:P
  ⧗:np ⧗:cur ⧗:fresh ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⦄ ⦃ ⧖ ⌁ ⧗⁰ ⦄ ⁼ ⧖:c2
  ⧗:P̵,c2 #4# ⧗:at △ ⊞ ‹pput› ⧖:P
  ⧗:P̵ ⧗:X̵ ⧗:j ⍆̵ ⧗:c2
⦄ ⟨⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ⟗ʃ ⟦ℤ⟧ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ⟩ ‹ptrec› ⸫

⍝ ‹ptcheck› path P: every header counts the module's planes, and no two planes share a z
⦃
  ⧖:path,P
  ⧗:P̵ ‹pnum› ⧖:P,np
  ⧗:patẖ,P̵,np ○
  ⥀ ⦃
    ⧖:path,P,np,p
    ⧗:patẖ,P̵,np,p ⧗:p ⧗:np ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⁼
      ⦃ ⧖:path,P,np,p ⧗:patẖ,P̵,np,p ‹ptcheck1› ⧖:P ⧗:patẖ,P̵,np ⧗:p △ ⊞ ⊕ ⦄
  ⦄
  ⧖:path,P,np,p ⧗:P̵
⦄ ⟨⟗ʃ ⟦ℤ⟧ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹ptcheck› ⸫
⦃
  ⧖:path,P,np,p
  ⧗:P̵,p ○ ‹pget› ⧖:P,z ⧗:P̵,p △ ‹pget› ⧖:P,n ⧗:P̵,p #2# ‹pget› ⧖:P,f
  ⧗:P̵,p #5# ‹pget› ⧖:P,hdr ⧗:P̵,p #6# ‹pget› ⧖:P,hl
  ⧗:P̵,p,z ‹psamez› ⧖:P,dup
  ⧗:hl ‹plline› ⧗:hdr ○ ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ △ ⦄ ∅ ⁼ ⧖:fl
  ⧗:n ⧗:np ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ○ ⦄ ⦃ △ ⦄ ⦃ #-1# ⦄ ⧖:cmp
  ⧗:patẖ,f,fl,z,n,np,cmp,hdr,dup
  ⧗:dup #-1# ᛖ ‹not› ⧗:cmp ○ ᛖ ‹not› ⋏ ⋔ ⦃ ‹ptbad› ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁̱ ⦄ ⁼
  ⧗:P̵
⦄ ⟨⟗ʃ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹ptcheck1› ⸫
⍝ ‹psamez› P p z: the first plane before p with the same z, or −1
⦃
  ⧖:P,p,z
  ⧗:P̵,p,z ○ #-1#
  ⥀ ⦃
    ⧖:P,p,z,q,found
    ⧗:P̵,p,z,q,found ⧗:q ⧗:p ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⁼ ⦃ ‹psamez1› ⊕ ⦄
  ⦄
  ⧖:P,p,z,q,found ⧗:P̵,found
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ⟩ ‹psamez› ⸫
⦃
  ⧖:P,p,z,q,found
  ⧗:P̵,q ○ ‹pget› ⧖:P,zq
  ⧗:P̵,p,z ⧗:q △ ⊞ ⧗:found ⧗:q ⧗:zq ⧗:z ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⧖ ⌁ ⧗⁰ ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⦄ ⁼
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ⟩ ‹psamez1› ⸫
⦃
  ⧖:path,f,fl,z,n,np,cmp,hdr,dup
  ⧗:patẖ,f,fl ‹erratfl›
  #3# ⧗:cmp △ ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ #2# ⦄ ∅ ⁼ ⧗:dup #-1# ᛖ ‹not› ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ △ ⦄ ∅ ⁼ ⧗:hdr ○ ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ #4# ⦄ ∅ ⁼ ⧖:code
  ⧗:z ⧗:code △ ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ $collapsed dimension: two planes have z = $ ⎙̵ ‹pbt› $ (A.1.2)$ ⎙̵ ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⦄ ⁼
  ⧗:n,np ⧗:code #2# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⧖:a,b $missing dimension: the header says $ ⎙̵ ⧗:a ᛁ $ planes, but the module has $ ⎙̵ ⧗:b ᛁ $ (A.1.2)$ ⎙̵ ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ ⦄ ⁼
  ⧗:n,np ⧗:code #3# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⧖:a,b $phantom dimension: the header says $ ⎙̵ ⧗:a ᛁ $ planes, but the module has $ ⎙̵ ⧗:b ᛁ $ (A.1.2)$ ⎙̵ ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ ⦄ ⁼
  ⧗:np ⧗:code #4# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ $phantom dimension: a file without a plane header is plane ○ of a one-plane module, but this module has $ ⎙̵ ᛁ $ planes (A.1.1)$ ⎙̵ ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⦄ ⁼
  $\n$ ⎙̵ △ ‹exit›
⦄ ⟨⟗ʃ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸⟩ ‹ptbad› ⸫

⍝ ‹ptorder› P: the planes in ascending z
⦃
  ⧖:P
  ⧗:P̵ ‹pnum› ⧖:P,np
  ⟦ ○ ⟧ ⧗:np ‹fillm1› ⧖:O
  ⧗:P̵,O̵,np ○
  ⥀ ⦃
    ⧖:P,O,np,p
    ⧗:P̵,O̵,np,p ⧗:p ⧗:np ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⁼
      ⦃ ⧖:P,O,np,p ⧗:P̵,p,np ‹prank› ⧖:P,r ⧗:P̵ ⧗:O̵,r,p ‹wr› ⧗:np ⧗:p △ ⊞ ⊕ ⦄
  ⦄
  ⧖:P,O,np,p ⧗:P̵,O̵
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹ptorder› ⸫
⍝ ‹prank› P p np: how many planes have a smaller z than p
⦃
  ⧖:P,p,np
  ⧗:P̵,p ○ ‹pget› ⧖:P,z
  ⧗:P̵,z,np ○ ○
  ⥀ ⦃
    ⧖:P,z,np,q,r
    ⧗:P̵,z,np,q,r ⧗:q ⧗:np ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⁼
      ⦃ ⧖:P,z,np,q,r ⧗:P̵,q ○ ‹pget› ⧖:P,zq ⧗:P̵,z,np ⧗:q △ ⊞ ⧗:r ⧗:zq ⧗:z ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⦄ ⦃ ⦄ ⦃ △ ⊞ ⦄ ⊕ ⦄
  ⦄
  ⧖:P,z,np,q,r ⧗:P̵,r
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ⟩ ‹prank› ⸫
⍝ ‹fillm1› a n: a with n slots of −1 appended
⦃
  ⧖:a,n
  ⧗:a̵,n
  ⥀ ⦃ ⧖:a,k ⧗:a̵,k ⧗:k ○ ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⦃ ⧖:a,k ⧗:a̵ #-1# ⍆̵ ⧗:k △ ⊟ ⊕ ⦄ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⦄
  ⌁
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹fillm1› ⸫

⍝ ‹fold› toks path: the folded token stream of a module's planes, breaths dropped and
⍝ each cell's x written into its line
⦃
  ⧖:toks,path
  ⧗:toks̱,patẖ ‹ptscan› ⧖:P,X
  ⧗:patẖ,P̵ ‹ptcheck› ⧖:P
  ⧗:P̵ ‹ptorder› ⧖:P,O
  ⧗:P̵ ‹pnum› ⧖:P,np
  ⧗:P̵,np ‹pcursors› ⧖:P,K
  ⧗:toks̱ ⟦ ○ ⟧ ○ #6# ‹copy› ⧖:out
  ⧗:toks̱,P̵,X̵,O̵,out̵,K̵,np △
  ⍝ the loop carries [toks P X O out K np y]
  ⥀ ⦃
    ⧖:toks,P,X,O,out,K,np,y
    ⧗:P̵,K̵,np ‹fdone› ⧖:P,K,done
    ⧗:toks̱,P̵,X̵,O̵,out̵,K̵,np,y ⧗:done ⋔ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄
      ⦃ ⧖:toks,P,X,O,out,K,np,y ⧗:toks̱,P̵,X̵,O̵,out̵,K̵,np,y ‹fline› ⧖:P,X,O,out,K,y ⧗:toks̱,P̵,X̵,O̵,out̵,K̵,np,y ⊕ ⦄ ⁼
  ⦄
  ⧖:toks,P,X,O,out,K,np,y
  ⧗:P̵ ⌁̵ ⧗:X̵ ⌁̵ ⧗:O̵ ⌁̵ ⧗:K̵ ⌁̵ ⧗:out̵
⦄ ⟨⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ⟗ʃ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹fold› ⸫
⍝ ‹pcursors› P np: each plane's first record
⦃
  ⧖:P,np
  ⧗:P̵ ⟦ ○ ⟧ ⧗:np ○
  ⥀ ⦃
    ⧖:P,K,np,p
    ⧗:P̵,K̵,np,p ⧗:p ⧗:np ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⁼
      ⦃ ⧖:P,K,np,p ⧗:P̵,p #3# ‹pget› ⧖:P,s ⧗:P̵ ⧗:K̵ ⧗:s ⍆̵ ⧗:np ⧗:p △ ⊞ ⊕ ⦄
  ⦄
  ⧖:P,K,np,p ⧗:P̵,K̵
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹pcursors› ⸫
⍝ ‹fdone› P K np: every plane is used up
⦃
  ⧖:P,K,np
  ⧗:P̵,K̵,np ○ ⦶
  ⥀ ⦃
    ⧖:P,K,np,p,acc
    ⧗:P̵,K̵,np,p,acc ⧗:p ⧗:np ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⁼
      ⦃ ⧖:P,K,np,p,acc ⧗:P̵,p #4# ‹pget› ⧖:P,e ⧗:K̵,p ‹rd› ⧖:K,k
        ⧗:P̵,K̵,np ⧗:p △ ⊞ ⧗:acc ⧗:k ⧗:e ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⦃ ⊕ ⦄ ⋎ ⊕ ⦄
  ⦄
  ⧖:P,K,np,p,acc ⧗:P̵,K̵,acc
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ⟦ℤ⟧ ŧ⟩ ‹fdone› ⸫

⍝ ‹fline› toks P X O out K np y: line y of every plane, cell by cell
⦃
  ⧖:toks,P,X,O,out,K,np,y
  ⧗:toks̱,P̵,X̵,K̵,np,y ‹flends› ⧖:P,X,K,L,w
  ⧗:toks̱,X̵,O̵,out̵,K̵,L̵,np,y,w ‹fcells› ⧖:X,O,out,K,L
  ⧗:K̵ ⌁̵
  ⧗:P̵,X̵,O̵,out̵,L̵ ⧗:y △ ⊞
⦄ ⟨⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ⟦ℤ⟧ ⟦ℤ⟧ ⟦ℤ⟧ ⟦ℤ⟧ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ⟦ℤ⟧ ⟦ℤ⟧ ⟦ℤ⟧ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ⟩ ‹fline› ⸫
⍝ ‹flends› toks P X K np y: where line y ends in each plane, and the widest line
⦃
  ⧖:toks,P,X,K,np,y
  ⧗:toks̱,P̵,X̵,K̵ ⟦ ○ ⟧ ⧗:np,y ○ ○
  ⍝ the loop carries [toks P X K L np y p w]
  ⥀ ⦃
    ⧖:toks,P,X,K,L,np,y,p,w
    ⧗:toks̱,P̵,X̵,K̵,L̵,np,y,p,w ⧗:p ⧗:np ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⁼
      ⦃ ⧖:toks,P,X,K,L,np,y,p,w ⧗:toks̱,P̵,X̵,K̵,L̵,y,p,w ‹flend1› ⧖:P,X,K,L,w
        ⧗:toks̱,P̵,X̵,K̵,L̵,np,y ⧗:p △ ⊞ ⧗:w ⊕ ⦄
  ⦄
  ⧖:toks,P,X,K,L,np,y,p,w ⧗:P̵,X̵,K̵,L̵,w
⦄ ⟨⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ⟦ℤ⟧ ⟦ℤ⟧ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ⟦ℤ⟧ ⟦ℤ⟧ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ⟩ ‹flends› ⸫
⦃
  ⧖:toks,P,X,K,L,y,p,w
  ⧗:K̵,p ‹rd› ⧖:K,k0
  ⧗:P̵,p #4# ‹pget› ⧖:P,e
  ⧗:toks̱,X̵,k0,e,y ‹fscan› ⧖:X,le
  ⧗:L̵ ⧗:le ⍆̵ ⧖:L
  ⧗:P̵,X̵,K̵,L̵ ⧗:w ⧗:le ⧗:k0 ⊟ ‹max›
⦄ ⟨⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ⟦ℤ⟧ ⟦ℤ⟧ ⟦ℤ⟧ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ⟦ℤ⟧ ⟦ℤ⟧ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ⟩ ‹flend1› ⸫
⍝ ‹fscan› toks X i e y: the first index ≥ i (and below e) whose record is not on line y
⦃
  ⧖:toks,X,i,e,y
  ⧗:toks̱,X̵,i,e,y
  ⥀ ⦃
    ⧖:toks,X,i,e,y
    ⧗:X̵,i ‹rd› ⧖:X,r
    ⧗:toks̱,X̵,i,e,y ⧗:i ⧗:e ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⊕ ⦄ ⁼ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⧗:toks̱ ⧗:r △ ⊞ ᚳ ‹ply› ⧗:y ᛖ ⋎
    ⋔ ⦃ ⧖:a,b △ ⊞ ⧗:a,b ⊕ ⦄ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⁼
  ⦄
  ⧖:toks,X,i,e,y ⧗:X̵,i
⦄ ⟨⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ⟩ ‹fscan› ⸫

⍝ ‹fcells› toks X O out K L np y w: the cells of line y, x by x
⦃
  ⧖:toks,X,O,out,K,L,np,y,w
  ⧗:toks̱,X̵,O̵,out̵,K̵,L̵,np,y,w ○
  ⍝ the loop carries [toks X O out K L np y w x]
  ⥀ ⦃
    ⧖:toks,X,O,out,K,L,np,y,w,x
    ⧗:toks̱,X̵,O̵,out̵,K̵,L̵,np,y,w,x ⧗:x ⧗:w ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⁼
      ⦃ ⧖:toks,X,O,out,K,L,np,y,w,x ⧗:toks̱,X̵,O̵,out̵,K̵,L̵,np,y,x ‹fcol› ⧖:X,O,out,K,L
        ⧗:toks̱,X̵,O̵,out̵,K̵,L̵,np,y,w ⧗:x △ ⊞ ⊕ ⦄
  ⦄
  ⧖:toks,X,O,out,K,L,np,y,w,x ⧗:X̵,O̵,out̵,K̵,L̵
⦄ ⟨⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ⟦ℤ⟧ ⟦ℤ⟧ ⟦ℤ⟧ ⟦ℤ⟧ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ⟦ℤ⟧ ⟦ℤ⟧ ⟦ℤ⟧ ⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹fcells› ⸫
⍝ ‹fcol› toks X O out K L np y x: the cells at x, the planes in ascending z on odd lines
⍝ and in descending z on even ones
⦃
  ⧖:toks,X,O,out,K,L,np,y,x
  ⧗:toks̱,X̵,O̵,out̵,K̵,L̵,np,y,x ○
  ⥀ ⦃
    ⧖:toks,X,O,out,K,L,np,y,x,k
    ⧗:toks̱,X̵,O̵,out̵,K̵,L̵,np,y,x,k ⧗:k ⧗:np ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⁼
      ⦃ ⧖:toks,X,O,out,K,L,np,y,x,k ⧗:toks̱,X̵,O̵,out̵,K̵,L̵,np,y,x,k ‹fcell› ⧖:X,O,out,K,L
        ⧗:toks̱,X̵,O̵,out̵,K̵,L̵,np,y,x ⧗:k △ ⊞ ⊕ ⦄
  ⦄
  ⧖:toks,X,O,out,K,L,np,y,x,k ⧗:X̵,O̵,out̵,K̵,L̵
⦄ ⟨⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ⟦ℤ⟧ ⟦ℤ⟧ ⟦ℤ⟧ ⟦ℤ⟧ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ⟦ℤ⟧ ⟦ℤ⟧ ⟦ℤ⟧ ⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹fcol› ⸫
⦃
  ⧖:toks,X,O,out,K,L,np,y,x,k
  ⧗:k ⧗:np ⧗:k ⊟ △ ⊟ ⧗:y ᚹ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⦄ ⦃ ⧖ ⌁ ⧗⁰ ⦄ ⁼ ⧖:kk
  ⧗:O̵,kk ‹rd› ⧖:O,p
  ⧗:K̵,p ‹rd› ⧖:K,k0
  ⧗:L̵,p ‹rd› ⧖:L,le
  ⧗:k0 ⧗:x ⊞ ⧖:i
  ⧗:X̵,i ‹rd› ⧖:X,r
  ⧗:i ⧗:le ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⊕ ⦄ ⁼ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⧗:toks̱,r ‹isbreath› ‹not› ⋎ ⧖:take
  ⧗:toks̱,out̵,r,x ⧗:take ⋔ ⦃ ‹femit› ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ ⧖:o ⌁̱ ⧗:o̵ ⦄ ⁼ ⧖:out
  ⧗:X̵,O̵,out̵,K̵,L̵
⦄ ⟨⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ⟦ℤ⟧ ⟦ℤ⟧ ⟦ℤ⟧ ⟦ℤ⟧ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ⟦ℤ⟧ ⟦ℤ⟧ ⟦ℤ⟧ ⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹fcell› ⸫
⍝ ‹femit› toks out r x: copy the record at r, its line carrying x
⦃
  ⧖:toks,out,r,x
  ⧗:out̵ ‹len› ⧖:out,at
  ⧗:toks̱,out̵,r ⧗:toks̱,r ‹reclen› ‹copy› ⧖:out
  ⧗:toks̱ ⧗:r △ ⊞ ᚳ ⧖:line
  ⧗:out̵ ⧗:at △ ⊞ ⧗:line,x ‹plsetx› ‹wr›
⦄ ⟨⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹femit› ⸫

⍝ ---- --fold and --unfold (A.1.4)

⍝ ‹foldpr› toks: the folded module in logical order, one line per y
⦃
  ⧖:toks
  ⧗:toks̱ #6# △ ⦶
  ⍝ the loop carries [toks j y first]
  ⥀ ⦃
    ⧖:toks,j,y,first
    ⧗:toks̱,j,y,first ⧗:j ⧗:toks̱ ᚴ ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⁼
      ⦃ ⧖:toks,j,y,first ⧗:toks̱,j,y,first ‹foldpr1› ⧖:j,y,first ⧗:toks̱,j,y,first ⊕ ⦄
  ⦄
  ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁̱ $\n$ ⎙̵
⦄ ⟨⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ⊸⟩ ‹foldpr› ⸫
⦃
  ⧖:toks,j,y,first
  ⧗:toks̱ ⧗:j △ ⊞ ᚳ ‹ply› ⧖:ry
  ⧗:ry ⧗:y ⊟ ‹pnl›
  ⧗:first ⧗:ry ⧗:y ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⦶ ⦄ ⦃ ⦄ ‹not› ⋔ ⦃ $ $ ⎙̵ ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  ⧗:toks̱,j ‹praw›
  ⧗:j ⧗:toks̱,j ‹reclen› ⊞ ⧗:ry ⊕
⦄ ⟨⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ŧ ⊸ ℤ ℤ ŧ⟩ ‹foldpr1› ⸫
⍝ ‹praw› toks j: print the raw text of the record at j
⦃
  ⧖:toks,j
  ⧗:toks̱ ⧗:j #7# ⊞ ᚳ ⧖:n
  ⧗:toks̱ ⧗:j #8# ⊞ ⧗:n ⊞ ᚳ ⧖:rn
  ⧗:toks̱ ⧗:j #9# ⊞ ⧗:n ⊞ ⧗:rn ‹ptext›
⦄ ⟨⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ⊸⟩ ‹praw› ⸫
⍝ ‹pnl› n: n newlines (none if n ≤ 0)
⦃
  ⥀ ⦃ ⧖:n ⧗:n ⧗:n ○ ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⦃ $\n$ ⎙̵ △ ⊟ ⊕ ⦄ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⦄
  ⌁
⦄ ⟨ℤ ⊸⟩ ‹pnl› ⸫
⍝ ‹psup› n: n ≥ 0 in superscript digits
⦃
  ⧖:n
  ⧗:n #10# ‹modp› ⧖:d
  ⧗:n ⧗:d ⊟ #10# ⊘ ⁇ ⦃ ⦄ ⦃ ○ ⦄ ⧖:q
  ⧗:q ⧗:q ○ ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⦄ ⦃ ‹psup› ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⦄
  ⧗:d ⍿⁰ △ ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ #185# ⦄ ⦃ ⍿⁰ #3# ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ #179# ⦄ ⦃ #8304# ⊞ ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ #178# ⦄ ⦄ ⦃ #8304# ⊞ ⦄ ᚢ
⦄ ⟨ℤ ⊸⟩ ‹psup› ⸫

⍝ ‹unfoldpr› toks n: a one-plane module dealt over n planes, cell by cell, as on-disk text.
⍝ Each line's cells go to the planes in turn (ascending z on odd lines, descending on even
⍝ ones), so folding the output gives the tokens back in order. The planes are z = −h … ,
⍝ h = ⌊(n−1)/2⌋, and a last line of breaths keeps the module balanced (§1.2).
⦃
  ⧖:toks,n
  ⧗:toks̱,n ○
  ⥀ ⦃
    ⧖:toks,n,i
    ⧗:toks̱,n,i ⧗:i ⧗:n ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⁼ ⦃ ⧖:toks,n,i ⧗:toks̱,n,i ‹unplane› ⧗:toks̱,n ⧗:i △ ⊞ ⊕ ⦄
  ⦄
  ⌁ ⌁ ⌁̱
  ⧗:toks̱ ‹nrec› #3# ‹modp› ⧖:r
  ⧗:r ○ ᛖ ‹not› ⋔ ⦃ $⸱$ ⎙̵ ⦄ ∅ ⁼ ⧗:r △ ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ $ ⸱$ ⎙̵ ⦄ ∅ ⁼ ⧗:r ○ ᛖ ‹not› ⋔ ⦃ $\n$ ⎙̵ ⦄ ∅ ⁼
⦄ ⟨⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ⊸⟩ ‹unfoldpr› ⸫
⍝ ‹nrec› toks: the number of records
⦃
  ⧖:toks
  ⧗:toks̱ #6# ○
  ⥀ ⦃
    ⧖:toks,j,c
    ⧗:toks̱,j,c ⧗:j ⧗:toks̱ ᚴ ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⁼ ⦃ ⧖:toks,j,c ⧗:toks̱ ⧗:j ⧗:toks̱,j ‹reclen› ⊞ ⧗:c △ ⊞ ⊕ ⦄
  ⦄
  ⧖:toks,j,c ⧗:c
⦄ ⟨⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ⊸ ℤ⟩ ‹nrec› ⸫
⍝ ‹unplane› toks n i: plane i, its header and its lines
⦃
  ⧖:toks,n,i
  ⧗:n △ ⊟ ⧗:n △ ⊟ #2# ‹modp› ⊟ #2# ⊘ ⁇ ⦃ ⦄ ⦃ ○ ⦄ ⧖:h
  $⧉ $ ⎙̵ ⧗:i ⧗:h ⊟ ‹pbt› $ $ ⎙̵ ⧗:n ‹psup› $\n$ ⎙̵
  ⧗:toks̱,n,i #6# ○
  ⍝ the loop carries [toks n i j py]
  ⥀ ⦃
    ⧖:toks,n,i,j,py
    ⧗:toks̱,n,i,j,py ⧗:j ⧗:toks̱ ᚴ ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⁼
      ⦃ ⧖:toks,n,i,j,py ⧗:toks̱,n,i,j,py ‹unline› ⧖:j,py ⧗:toks̱,n,i,j,py ⊕ ⦄
  ⦄
  ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁̱
⦄ ⟨⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ⊸⟩ ‹unplane› ⸫
⍝ ‹unline› toks n i j py: the cells of plane i on the line that starts at record j
⦃
  ⧖:toks,n,i,j,py
  ⧗:toks̱ ⧗:j △ ⊞ ᚳ ⧖:y
  ⧗:y ⧗:py ⊟ △ ⊟ ‹pnl›
  ⧗:toks̱,j,y ‹ungather› ⧖:R,je
  ⧗:R̵ ‹len› ⧖:R,m
  ⧗:toks̱,R̵,m,n,i,y ‹untoks›
  $\n$ ⎙̵
  ⧗:je ⧗:y
⦄ ⟨⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ℤ ℤ⟩ ‹unline› ⸫
⍝ ‹ungather› toks j y: the records of line y from j on, and where the next line starts
⦃
  ⧖:toks,j,y
  ⧗:toks̱ ⟦ ○ ⟧ ⧗:j,y
  ⥀ ⦃
    ⧖:toks,R,j,y
    ⧗:toks̱,R̵,j,y ⧗:j ⧗:toks̱ ᚴ ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⊕ ⦄ ⁼ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⧗:toks̱ ⧗:j △ ⊞ ᚳ ⧗:y ᛖ ⋎
    ⋔ ⦃ ⧖:toks,R,j,y ⧗:R̵ ⧗:j ⍆̵ ⧖:R ⧗:toks̱,R̵ ⧗:j ⧗:toks̱,j ‹reclen› ⊞ ⧗:y ⊕ ⦄ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⁼
  ⦄
  ⧖:toks,R,j,y ⧗:R̵,j
⦄ ⟨⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ⟩ ‹ungather› ⸫
⍝ ‹untoks› toks R m n i y: plane i's cells among the m records R of line y, in on-disk order
⦃
  ⧖:toks,R,m,n,i,y
  ⧗:n ⧗:i ⊟ △ ⊟ ⧖:r
  ⧗:m △ ⊟ ⧗:r ⊟ ⧖:span
  ⧗:span ⧗:span ⧗:n ‹modp› ⊟ ⧗:r ⊞ ⧖:tlast
  ⧗:i ⧗:tlast ⧗:y ᚹ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⦄ ⦃ ⧖ ⌁ ⧗⁰ ⦄ ⁼ ⧖:t0
  ⧗:n ⧗:n ⊝ ⧗:y ᚹ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⦄ ⦃ ⧖ ⌁ ⧗⁰ ⦄ ⁼ ⧖:step
  ⧗:toks̱,R̵,m,step,y,t0 ⦶
  ⍝ the loop carries [toks R m step y t first]
  ⥀ ⦃
    ⧖:toks,R,m,step,y,t,first
    ⧗:toks̱,R̵,m,step,y,t,first ⧗:t ○ ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⦃ ⊕ ⦄ ⧗:t ⧗:m ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⊕ ⦄ ⁼ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⋎
    ⋔ ⦃ ⧖:toks,R,m,step,y,t,first ⧗:toks̱,R̵,y,t,first ‹untok› ⧖:R ⧗:toks̱,R̵,m,step,y ⧗:t ⧗:step ⊞ ⊕ ⊕ ⦄ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⁼
  ⦄
  ⧖:toks,R,m,step,y,t,first ⧗:R̵ ⌁̵
⦄ ⟨⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸⟩ ‹untoks› ⸫
⦃
  ⧖:toks,R,y,t,first
  ⧗:first ‹not› ⋔ ⦃ $ $ ⎙̵ ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  ⧗:R̵,t ‹rd› ⧖:R,r
  ⧗:toks̱,r,y ‹pphys›
  ⧗:R̵
⦄ ⟨⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ŧ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹untok› ⸫
⍝ ‹pphys› toks j y: the token at j as it is written on line y: on an even line a bracket
⍝ and a string's delimiters are mirrored (§1.1)
⦃
  ⧖:toks,j,y
  ⧗:toks̱,j ᚳ ⧖:kind
  ○ ⧗:kind #11# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ △ ⦄ ∅ ⁼ ⧗:kind #12# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ #2# ⦄ ∅ ⁼ ⧗:y ᚹ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ○ ⦄ ∅ ⁼ ⧖:code
  ⧗:toks̱,j,code ⍿⁰ ○ ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ‹praw› ⦄ ⦃ △ ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ‹pmirb› ⦄ ⦃ ‹pmirs› ⦄ ⁼ ⦄ ⁼
⦄ ⟨⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ⊸⟩ ‹pphys› ⸫
⦃
  ⧖:toks,j
  ⧗:toks̱ ⧗:j #7# ⊞ ᚳ ⧖:n
  ⧗:toks̱ ⧗:j #9# ⊞ ⧗:n ⊞ ᚳ ᛘ ᚢ
⦄ ⟨⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ⊸⟩ ‹pmirb› ⸫
⦃
  ⧖:toks,j
  ⧗:toks̱ ⧗:j #7# ⊞ ᚳ ⧖:n
  ⧗:toks̱ ⧗:j #8# ⊞ ⧗:n ⊞ ᚳ ⧖:rn
  ⧗:j #9# ⊞ ⧗:n ⊞ ⧖:b
  #171# ᚢ ⧗:toks̱ ⧗:b △ ⊞ ⧗:n ‹ptext› #187# ᚢ ⧗:toks̱ ⧗:b #2# ⊞ ⧗:n ⊞ ⧗:rn #2# ⊟ ⧗:n ⊟ ‹ptext›
⦄ ⟨⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ⊸⟩ ‹pmirs› ⸫

⍝ ‹segend› C s: the length of the first file's path in the heap string s (up to the first U+0001)
⦃
  ⧖:C,s
  ⧗:C̵,s ‹slen› ⧖:C,n
  ⧗:C̵,s ○ ⧗:n
  ⥀ ⦃
    ⧖:C,s,j,n
    ⧗:C̵,s,j ‹sat› ⧖:C,c
    ⧗:C̵,s,j,n ⧗:j ⧗:n ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⊕ ⦄ ⁼ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⧗:c △ ᛖ ‹not› ⋎ ⋔ ⦃ ⧖:a △ ⊞ ⧗:a ⊕ ⦄ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⁼
  ⦄
  ⧖:C,s,j,n ⧗:C̵,j
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ⟩ ‹segend› ⸫

⍝ ‹modp› x n: x mod n in 0 … n−1 (⊜ gives the balanced remainder, which may be negative)
⦃ ⧖:x,n ⧗:n ⧗:x ⧗:n ⊜ ⁇ ⦃ ⦄ ⦃ ○ ⦄ ⍿⁰ ○ ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⧖ ⌁ ⧗⁰ ⦄ ⦃ ⧖ ⌁ ⧗⁰ ⦄ ⦃ ⊞ ⦄ ⦄ ⟨ℤ ℤ ⊸ ℤ⟩ ‹modp› ⸫
